# checkout of a branch must stop before it overwrites an untracked file.
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
> branch other
<<<
> checkout other
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "other adds f"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
* f.txt
+ f.txt notwug.txt
> checkout other
There is an untracked file in the way; delete it, or add and commit it first.
<<<
= f.txt notwug.txt
